@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Supplier Offer History

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Supplier Portal
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Show the revision history of the supplier’s own offers, with
a downloadable personal offer history and summary.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Supplier (own company only, Admin-approved)

ROUTE: /Supplier/Offers/History/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Own bids grouped by TenderInvitation, ordered by
  RevisionNumber.
- Downloadable personal history/summary (PDF/Excel) for the
  own company only (spec §16).
- Show outcomes only after the award is final; never show
  competitors’ prices or scores.

DEPENDENCIES:
Bids, TenderInvitations, Tenders.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Every query must be filtered by the signed-in user’s
SupplierId. Never show other suppliers’ invitations, offers,
prices or evaluations.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Supplier Offer History";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "My Offers";
    ViewData["Description"] = "All revisions of your offers.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="pg-toolbar" aria-label="Export my offer history">
    <button type="button" class="pg-btn" disabled title="PDF export is not implemented yet">Download PDF</button>
    <button type="button" class="pg-btn" disabled title="Excel export is not implemented yet">Download Excel</button>
    <span class="pg-hint">Export of my offer history is not implemented yet. Exports must contain only data this user may see.</span>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-revisions">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-revisions">Revisions</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tender</th><th scope="col">Revision</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Created</th><th scope="col">Submitted</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="5"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No offer revisions yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-outcome-summary">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-outcome-summary">Outcome summary</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tender</th><th scope="col">Invitation response</th><th scope="col">Offer submitted</th><th scope="col">Final outcome (published)</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="4"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No completed tenders yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
